Band Visual & Press Photoshoot Prompt: A gothic, almost monastic trio, silhouetted against a violently strobing, corroded red traffic light in a desolate, overgrown urban intersection at dusk. Elara, with eyes downcast, holds a microphone fashioned from a broken pedestrian signal. Kael, wearing a gas mask, beats rusted license plates with mallets. Ronan, hunched over a chaotic nest of exposed wires, blinking LEDs, and green-glowing CRT screens, pulls grotesque, spectral tones from salvaged control boards. The atmosphere is oppressive, dark, and utterly isolated, like an ancient cult performing an arcane ritual for forgotten spirits of the digital age.

Mood or Vibe: Post-apocalyptic melancholia, digital spiritualism, liturgical dread, signal collapse, protest against algorithmic control.

